    "gitCommitMessage": "Tab bar to legacy look + smoother Duolingo-style feedback\n\nTab bar: rebuild to match the legacy web UI — legacy icon glyphs (music\nnote / page / piano / person), Nunito-900 labels (the font was loaded but\nnever applied), and legacy proportions (64px cream bar, 1.5px ink-line top\nborder, 20px icons, 11px labels). Keep a clean brand-green active state with\na gentle icon pop; drop the white bar, drop shadow, and sliding gradient.\nAdd a Nunito fontFamily token so text actually renders in Nunito.\n\nSmoothness:\n- Learn header stat pills now count up via AnimatedCounter, and the daily-XP\n  bar tweens its width instead of snapping when you return from a lesson.\n- Lesson progress bar glides between steps instead of jumping in chunks.\n- REPLAY is now dimmed/disabled during the play phase (it previously gave\n  haptic feedback but did nothing there, which read as broken).",
